*
!Dockerfile.openclaw
!requirements.lock
!runtime-packages/
!runtime-packages/**
!runtime-extensions/
!runtime-extensions/vc-trusted-context/
!runtime-extensions/vc-trusted-context/**
!workspaces/
!workspaces/**
# Host-generated workspace state must never bake into the reviewed image.
workspaces/*/.openclaw/
workspaces/*/memory/
workspaces/**/__pycache__/
workspaces/**/*.pyc
workspaces/**/*.log
# Only the exec-approvals seed may enter the build context. Never re-include
# all of config/: lifecycle renders materialize live secrets under
# config/runtime/secrets/ before `compose build` runs, and a blanket !config/
# would ship them (plus operator profiles) into the builder context cache.
!config/exec-approvals.json
